# .hq unified store: work/ is regenerable output, runtime/ is session state,
# locks, logs, and anything sensitive. community/ and config/ stay tracked
# (store-spec §3, §5). The `**/` prefix is required because anchors nest.
**/.hq/work/
**/.hq/runtime/
